<!--
  The monogram, drawn to the adaptive-icon safe zone: the outer third of
  a 108dp canvas can be masked away by the launcher, so the mark sits
  inside the middle 72dp (roughly x/y 18-90).

  A vector rather than the supplied PNG logo, because an adaptive icon
  foreground is masked to arbitrary shapes and a bitmap wordmark crops
  badly. brand.md §4 forbids recolouring the supplied mark, so this is a
  plain letterform rather than an altered version of it.
-->
